        {
          "text": " Keŋaiŋait yes, iinacan, kanuka Ejakaitiwok Yesu Kristo, kanuka amin da naka Emoyo, koutas nepepe keoŋ kotoma ailipikus kanukaŋ mama ejai Edeke, ",
